26.583" end="1:27.190">当你</span><span begin="1:27.190" end="1:28.330">昼夜骑士</span> <span begin="1:28.330" end="1:29.532">烈阳的树</span><span begin="1:29.532" end="1:29.925">荫</span></p><p begin="1:30.035" end="1:33.682" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.035" end="1:30.692">让花</span><span begin="1:30.692" end="1:31.890">朵为你吟</span><span begin="1:31.890" end="1:33.050">游的魔术</span><span begin="1:33.050" end="1:33.682">师</span></p><p begin="1:33.835" end="1:39.964" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.835" end="1:34.218">每</span><span begin="1:34.218" end="1:35.415">一道有你</span><span begin="1:35.415" end="1:36.016">风景</span> <span begin="1:36.016" end="1:37.185">帮你按下</span><span begin="1:37.185" end="1:38.357">快门的秘</span><span begin="1:38.357" end="1:38.932">密情</span><span begin="1:38.932" end="1:39.964">人</span></p></div><div begin="1:41.723" end="2:09.573" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:41.723" end="1:48.675" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.723" end="1:42.471">什么</span><span begin="1:42.471" end="1:43.620">爱</span><span begin="1:43.936" end="1:44.236">不</span><span begin="1:44.236" end="1:45.277">说</span><span begin="1:45.688" end="1:45.996">就</span><span begin="1:45.996" end="1:47.702">已经存</span><span begin="1:47.702" end="1:48.675">在</span></p><p begin="1:48.842" end="1:55.677" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.842" end="1:49.506">什么</span><span begin="1:49.506" end="1:50.743">爱</span><span begin="1:50.923" end="1:51.275">望</span><span begin="1:51.275" end="1:52.367">着</span><span begin="1:52.686" end="1:52.994">就</span><span begin="1:52.994" end="1:54.767">全都明</span><span begin="1:54.767" end="1:55.677">白</span></p><p begin="1:55.904" end="1:59.729" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.904" end="1:56.535">你笑</span><span begin="1:56.535" end="1:57.135">一点</span><span begin="1:57.135" end="1:57.717">一点</span><span begin="1:57.717" end="1:58.292">一滴</span><span begin="1:58.292" end="1:58.846">